{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116503","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116503/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116503/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116503/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116503","id":3965014666,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7E_Hhs","number":116503,"title":"Fix TabContainer tab icon, disabled, and hidden not saved before ready","user":{"login":"oCHIKIo","id":108464117,"node_id":"U_kgDOBncH9Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108464117?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo","html_url":"https://github.com/oCHIKIo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oCHIKIo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-02-19T20:46:42Z","updated_at":"2026-04-28T13:08:07Z","closed_at":"2026-04-28T13:07:53Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116503","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116503","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116503.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116503.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fixes #116358\r\n\r\n`TabContainer` stores tab properties (icon, disabled, hidden) in a temporary\r\nbuffer `pending_tabs` before the node receives `NOTIFICATION_READY`, then\r\nflushes them into the internal `tab_bar`, the setters (`set_tab_icon`,\r\n`set_tab_disabled`, `set_tab_hidden`) correctly wrote to `pending_tabs`, but\r\nthe getters (`get_tab_icon`, `is_tab_disabled`, `is_tab_hidden`) always read\r\nfrom `tab_bar`, which is empty before ready.\r\n\r\nsince `PropertyListHelper` calls the getter during serialization and skips\r\nsaving any property that matches its default value, these properties were\r\nnever written to the scene file and lost on reload.\r\n\r\nthis PR makes the three getters check `!is_ready()` first, if the node\r\nisn't ready and the index is within `pending_tabs` bounds, they return the\r\nbuffered value instead of reading from `tab_bar`.","closed_by":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.